A game simulator for Hanabi [1].

The core game mechanics live in main.py.

Gameplay analysis logic lives in monte_carlo_harness.py
An example player is encoded in unambiguous_hinting_player.py

[1] Hanabi is an asymetric information cooperative game. It has an interesting
    mechanic where you can see everyone else's hand, but can't see your own. It's
    fun!
